(e)
reduction to the ranks or to a lower rank in the case of sailors;
(f)
forfeiture of seniority of rank, forfeiture of all or any part of the service for the purpose of promotion;
(g)
forfeiture of service for the purpose of increased pay, pension or any other prescribed purpose;
(h)
fine, in respect of civil offences;
(i)
mulcts of pay and allowances;
(j)
severe reprimand or reprimand except in the case of persons below the rank of an Uttam Navik or Uttam Yantrik.
(2)
Each of the punishments specified in sub-section (1) shall be deemed to be inferior in degree to every punishment
preceding it in the above scale.
